- **Added:** first toroidal inductive-conductivity family on a caustic evaporator with a recomputable κ=k_c·I/V (`16.00 mS/cm`) plus drive-ratio identity and three-party collusion including the conductivity infra owner; first electrochemical-H2S family on a sour-water stripper vent with recomputable C=k_h·(I−I0) (`12.00 ppm`) and cell-delta identity, plus a resolved-innocent cell tech (timezone-skipped electrolyte-zero, not last-to-badge); first free-space FMCW tank-radar remaining-level family on a crude atmospheric still with recomputable L=k_r·Δf (`12.00 m`) plus sweep identity; bounded ACCEPT whose out-of-scope clause is adjacent stills rather than a hopper/taphole/dump cap; operational t2 on all three (liquor-hold, new-cell restart, skip-still refusal); provenance trio designed/hil/simulated; 18 min / 24 min / 12 min slow floors in-stream.
- **Still thin:** (i) 184's k_c is a lumped cell-constant, not a temperature / fouling table — a 8 K liquor hop that fakes 16.00 mS/cm inside a 4.80 Torveil corridor is unwritten; (ii) 185's k_h is a lumped cell gain, not a humidity / electrolyte-age map, so a dry-membrane hop that fakes 12.00 ppm is unwritten; (iii) 186's k_r is a lumped chirp-to-range gain, not a dielectric / foam-layer map, so a foam hop that fakes 12.00 m inside a 4.80 last-good is unwritten; (iv) vendor-only as a *lead* REJECT on a plant with *no* independent toroid/H2S/radar installed yet remains slightly harder — 184/185 still have plant heads; (v) stream amplitudes remain authored constants (raster draws are the only seeded noise); (vi) r56 densification leftovers (IRIS c(T), slag-window pyrometer, OIW quenching) were left for that round's owner.